        "detailed_description": "Every enemy in the dungeon dies in one hit. So do you.<br><br>Each foe glows with its weakness. Read it, hold the matching element — Water, Fire, Shock or Leaf — and strike before the window closes. Hit and the combo grows, the music swells, the ink flies. Miss and you pay in blood.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it plays</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One glance, one decision, one strike — combat that plays like rhythm<br></li><li>Land perfect strikes at the last moment to earn your health back<br></li><li>Chain kills to raise your multiplier and unlock new layers of the soundtrack</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Two modes:</strong> Classic Corridor (tactical, paced) and Nonstop Runner (never stop moving)<br></li><li><strong>Global leaderboards</strong> — climb the ranks in both modes<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>A hand-inked comic look with music that reacts to your combo<br></li><li>Full controller support, runs great on Steam Deck<br></li><li>Interface in 10 languages</li></ul><br>Runs last minutes. The scoreboard lasts forever.<br><br>• Animation improvements <br>• Enemy variety <br>• Character customization <br>• Boss fights &amp; rewards <br>• Optional parry <br>• Multiplayer: PvP &amp; PvE",
